  <h3 class="page-subsection--title">Contributors</h3>
  <p>We counted on them for particular parts of the project.</p>

  <ul class="team">
    <li class="team--member">
      <img class="team--photo" src="{% static_image '/files/team/marina.jpg' %}" width="200" height="200" alt="Marina Nieto Tirado" loading="lazy">
      <h3 class="team--name">Marina Nieto Tirado</h3>
      <p class="team--role">English translations (2013-2018)</p>
      <p>
        Born in Jaén and living in London for more than 10 years. With a BA in English language, I
        work as a photographer and as an official tourist guide in London (Blue Badge).
      </p>
    </li>
    <li class="team--member">
      <img class="team--photo" src="{% static_image '/files/team/deni.jpg' %}" width="200" height="200" alt="Deni Meseguer" loading="lazy">
      <h3 class="team--name">Deni Meseguer</h3>
      <p class="team--role">Aerial video</p>
      <p>
        I am from Jerez but I live in Jaén. I am a systems administrator and passionate about
        flying drones. I could not resist collaborating with Lugares Míticos de Jaén, showing a
        bird's-eye view of so many amazing places full of history.
      </p>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    Marina translated the 57 articles published in both languages, and Deni filmed the drone
    videos in several of them: they are listed on the
    <a href="/en/copyright#contributions">copyright</a> page. The 107 articles that stayed in
    Spanish only were translated automatically in 2026, with artificial intelligence (Claude, by
    Anthropic), when this site was rebuilt; Marina did not review them.
  </p>
</section>

